Module moongate "A gate that opens only by night" {
  Place grounds "the abbey grounds" is settlement.
  Place yard "the yard" is room within grounds at 0, 0.
  Place garden "the moon garden" is room within grounds at 1, 0.
  Company party "You" of 1 at yard.
  Passage gate "the moon gate" is gate between yard and garden
    opening when dark() "The moon gate is a ring of white stone with the wall showing through it. By day it is only a ring.".
}
